# Unreal build outputs (the repo .gitignore covers these too; repeated so CSharp/ stands on its own).
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
# .NET build outputs of the managed projects (and of the plugin's own managed code).
bin/
obj/
*.sln
.vs/
# Written by UnrealSharp on each build (machine paths / copies of the plugin's own files).
Script/global.json
Script/*.sln.projects.json
Script/**/Properties/launchSettings.json
